163	     * when the owner has no namesakes (namesakeCount is 0); add 2 when the owner belongs to a
164	     * household of 3 or more (see {@link #hasHouseholdBonus(Owner)}); add 3 when the owner's tenure
165	     * exceeds 365 days (see {@link #hasTenureBonus(Owner)}). Because a newly created owner has zero
166	     * tenure it never earns the tenure points, so a new owner with an email and no namesakes in a
167	     * single-member household scores 3 points.
